{
  "format": "field",
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "name": "Resonant Drone Synth",
    "author": "Infinite",
    "description": "Microtonal cluster drone synthesizer with 5 detuned prime-ratio oscillators, organic phase drift and warm acoustic body saturation.",
    "domain": "synth"
  },
  "device": {
    "code": "param float spread = 0.35 [0.0, 1.0];\nparam float warmth = 0.6 [0.0, 1.0];\nparam float driftSpeed = 0.4 [0.05, 3.0];\nparam float subBass = 0.5 [0.0, 1.0];\nparam float cutoff = 3200.0 [200.0, 10000.0];\nstate float p1 = 0;\nstate float p2 = 0;\nstate float p3 = 0;\nstate float p4 = 0;\nstate float p5 = 0;\nstate float pSub = 0;\nstate float lfo1 = 0;\nstate float lfo2 = 0;\nstate float lp = 0;\n\nbaseStep = clamp(freq, 20.0, 4000.0) / sr;\n\nl1Step = driftSpeed * 0.37 / sr;\nl2Step = driftSpeed * 0.53 / sr;\nlfo1 = (lfo1 + l1Step) % 1.0;\nlfo2 = (lfo2 + l2Step) % 1.0;\n\nd1 = 1.0 + sin(6.2831853 * lfo1) * 0.003 * spread;\nd2 = 1.004 + cos(6.2831853 * lfo2) * 0.004 * spread;\nd3 = 1.4983 + sin(6.2831853 * lfo2 * 1.3) * 0.003 * spread;\nd4 = 2.0012 + cos(6.2831853 * lfo1 * 0.7) * 0.002 * spread;\nd5 = 2.996 + sin(6.2831853 * (lfo1 + lfo2)) * 0.005 * spread;\n\np1 = (p1 + baseStep * d1) % 1.0;\np2 = (p2 + baseStep * d2) % 1.0;\np3 = (p3 + baseStep * d3) % 1.0;\np4 = (p4 + baseStep * d4) % 1.0;\np5 = (p5 + baseStep * d5) % 1.0;\npSub = (pSub + baseStep * 0.5) % 1.0;\n\ns1 = sin(6.2831853 * p1) * 0.32;\ns2 = sin(6.2831853 * p2) * 0.28;\ns3 = sin(6.2831853 * p3) * 0.22;\ns4 = sin(6.2831853 * p4) * 0.18;\ns5 = sin(6.2831853 * p5) * 0.14;\nsSub = sin(6.2831853 * pSub) * subBass * 0.45;\n\ncluster = s1 + s2 + s3 + s4 + s5 + sSub;\ndrive = 1.0 + warmth * 1.5;\nu = cluster * drive;\nsat = u / (1.0 + abs(u) * 0.28);\n\nfCut = clamp(cutoff / sr * 2.0, 0.01, 0.45);\nlp = lp + fCut * (sat - lp);\n\nout = lp * 0.85;\n",
    "params": {
      "spread": 0.35,
      "warmth": 0.6,
      "driftSpeed": 0.4,
      "subBass": 0.5,
      "cutoff": 3200.0
    },
    "nodeSettings": {
      "maxVoices": 8
    }
  }
}